---
// src/pages/components/moderacao/UrlRotationSection.astro
---

<div id="url-rotation-section" class="hidden space-y-4 animate-in fade-in duration-500">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-[#141414] p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-amber-500 rounded-full"></span>
            <h3 class="text-white text-sm font-semibold">
                Substituição &amp; rotação de URL <span class="text-gray-500 font-normal">— Anti-DMCA</span>
            </h3>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button id="sync-rotations-btn" type="button" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/10 transition-colors text-xs font-medium px-3 py-2 rounded-lg">
                Sincronizar
            </button>
            <button id="clear-rotations-btn" type="button" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-[#DF0912] bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-[#DF0912]/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-[#DF0912]/30 transition-colors text-xs font-medium px-3 py-2 rounded-lg">
                Limpar todas
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Explicação -->
    <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-5">
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                Quando o Google remove uma URL por direitos autorais (Lumen Database), cole o link aqui. O sistema
                altera o slug adicionando ou incrementando o sufixo numérico (-1, -2, -3...) sem alterar os dados,
                permitindo reenviar a nova URL para indexação imediata.
            </p>

            <div class="flex items-center bg-[#060911] p-1 rounded-lg border border-white/10 shrink-0">
                <button id="rot-mode-single" type="button" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-md text-xs font-medium transition-colors bg-[#DF0912] text-white">
                    URL única
                </button>
                <button id="rot-mode-batch" type="button" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-md text-xs font-medium transition-colors text-gray-400 hover:text-white">
                    Lote de URLs
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Verificação de bloqueio legal (451 do Cloudflare) -->
    <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <h4 class="text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#DF0912] rounded-full"></span>
                    URLs bloqueadas por notificação <span class="text-gray-500 font-normal">(erro HTTP 451)</span>
                </h4>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                    Testa o endereço <strong class="text-gray-300">atual</strong> de cada rotação e lista as que devolvem
                    <code class="text-amber-300 font-mono">451 Unavailable For Legal Reasons</code> — o bloqueio caiu em cima
                    do slug canônico de hoje. Rotacionar essas obras move o canônico para um slug novo, que volta a
                    responder 200 e é anunciado no sitemap.
                </p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                    O teste é sempre contra o <strong class="text-gray-400">domínio canônico atual</strong>. Bloqueios que
                    ficaram nas zonas de domínios antigos não aparecem aqui — depois de uma migração, o resultado
                    normal é zero.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
                <button id="check-blocks-btn" type="button" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/10 transition-colors text-xs font-medium px-3 py-2 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-4.35-4.35M17 11a6 6 0 11-12 0 6 6 0 0112 0z"/></svg>
                    <span>Verificar bloqueios</span>
                    <div id="check-blocks-spinner" class="animate-spin h-3 w-3 border-2 border-white border-t-transparent rounded-full hidden"></div>
                </button>
                <button id="rotate-blocked-btn" type="button" disabled class="bg-[#DF0912] hover:bg-[#be080f] disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed text-white font-semibold transition-colors text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
                    <span id="rotate-blocked-label">Rotacionar bloqueadas</span>
                    <div id="rotate-blocked-spinner" class="animate-spin h-3 w-3 border-2 border-white border-t-transparent rounded-full hidden"></div>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="blocked-feedback" class="hidden p-3.5 rounded-lg border text-xs"></div>
        <div id="blocked-list" class="hidden divide-y divide-white/[0.06] max-h-[420px] overflow-y-auto rounded-lg border border-white/10"></div>

        <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            A verificação testa a URL em português. Se o bloqueio estiver na URL <span class="font-mono">/en/</span> da
            obra, rotacione essa obra com o idioma <span class="font-mono">en</span> (ou "Ambos") no formulário abaixo —
            o slug inglês passa a ter rotação própria e a URL antiga responde 301.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Checagem sob demanda de qualquer URL -->
    <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <h4 class="text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#DF0912] rounded-full"></span>
                    Checar URLs soltas <span class="text-gray-500 font-normal">(status HTTP real)</span>
                </h4>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                    Cole uma URL por linha para ver o status que o <strong class="text-gray-300">Googlebot</strong> recebe
                    hoje. Serve para URLs que ainda não têm rotação cadastrada — inclusive as de
                    <span class="font-mono">/en/</span>. HEAD com fallback para GET, timeout de 10s.
                </p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                    Até 50 URLs por chamada, 5 em paralelo. A checagem roda no servidor, então o resultado é o status
                    público — não depende do seu navegador.
                </p>
            </div>
            <button id="check-urls-btn" type="button" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/10 transition-colors text-xs font-medium px-3 py-2 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
                <span>Checar URLs</span>
                <div id="check-urls-spinner" class="animate-spin h-3 w-3 border-2 border-white border-t-transparent rounded-full hidden"></div>
            </button>
        </div>

        <textarea
            id="check-urls-input"
            rows="4"
            placeholder="https://multicanaishd.lol/en/filme/603-the-matrix&#10;https://multicanaishd.lol/serie/1396-breaking-bad&#10;/filme/157336-interstellar"
            class="w-full bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-3.5 text-xs text-white placeholder:text-gray-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#DF0912]/60 transition-colors font-mono leading-relaxed"
        ></textarea>

        <div id="check-urls-feedback" class="hidden p-3.5 rounded-lg border text-xs"></div>
        <div id="check-urls-list" class="hidden divide-y divide-white/[0.06] max-h-[420px] overflow-y-auto rounded-lg border border-white/10"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Detecção automática de bloqueio legal (451) -->
    <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <h4 class="text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full"></span>
                    Detecção automática <span class="text-gray-500 font-normal">(451 do Cloudflare)</span>
                </h4>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                    Um job de cron lê a cada 10 minutos o relatório da Analytics API do Cloudflare com as URLs que
                    responderam <code class="text-amber-300 font-mono">451</code>. Quando o caminho bloqueado é o
                    <strong class="text-gray-300">canônico atual</strong> da obra, o slug é rotacionado sozinho (PT e
                    EN, cada um no seu idioma). Slugs antigos já rotacionados são registrados como
                    <span class="font-mono">ignorado</span> e não geram rotação nova.
                </p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                    O token da API fica na env var <span class="font-mono">CLOUDFLARE_ANALYTICS_TOKEN</span> (secret do
                    deploy) e a zona é resolvida pelo domínio canônico, com cache de 24h no KV — trocar de domínio não
                    exige mexer no código.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Toggle no mesmo padrão do provedor de anúncios (Configurações) -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <label for="dmca-auto-rotate-select" class="block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">Auto-rotação</label>
                    <select
                        id="dmca-auto-rotate-select"
                        data-active-auto-rotate="on"
                        class="bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#DF0912]/60 transition-colors"
                    >
                        <option value="on">Ligada</option>
                        <option value="off">Desligada</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div id="dmca-toggle-spinner" class="animate-spin h-3.5 w-3.5 border-2 border-[#DF0912] border-t-transparent rounded-full hidden self-end mb-3"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="dmca-token-alerta" class="hidden p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Token de analytics não configurado.</strong> Sem
            <span class="font-mono">CLOUDFLARE_ANALYTICS_TOKEN</span> no ambiente do deploy, o job do cron devolve
            <span class="font-mono">token_ausente</span> e nada é detectado. O log abaixo pode continuar vazio mesmo com
            URLs bloqueadas.
        </div>

        <div id="dmca-log-feedback" class="hidden p-3.5 rounded-lg border text-xs"></div>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="hidden sm:grid grid-cols-[130px_1fr_70px_120px_1fr] gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white/[0.03] border-b border-white/10 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-semibold">
                <span>Quando</span>
                <span>Caminho bloqueado</span>
                <span class="text-right">Req.</span>
                <span>Ação</span>
                <span>Slug novo</span>
            </div>
            <div id="dmca-log-list" class="hidden divide-y divide-white/[0.06] max-h-[420px] overflow-y-auto"></div>
            <div id="dmca-log-empty" class="p-8 text-center">
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Nenhuma detecção registrada ainda.</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 mt-1">O job roda a cada 10 minutos; a lista aparece no primeiro 451 detectado.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                "Recarregar log" só relê o histórico gravado no KV. Quem dispara a detecção é o cron, com o
                <span class="font-mono">CRON_SECRET</span> — que não vai para o navegador.
            </p>
            <button id="dmca-refresh-btn" type="button" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/10 transition-colors text-xs font-medium px-3 py-2 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
                <span>Recarregar log</span>
                <div id="dmca-refresh-spinner" class="animate-spin h-3 w-3 border-2 border-white border-t-transparent rounded-full hidden"></div>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Migration SQL Box (exibido só se a tabela não existir) -->
    <div id="rot-migration-alert" class="hidden bg-[#141414] border border-amber-500/20 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
            <h4 class="text-white text-sm font-semibold">Ação no banco necessária: tabela <code class="text-amber-300 font-mono">url_rotations</code></h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
            Execute o script abaixo no SQL Editor do seu Supabase. Ele cria a tabela se ainda não existir e, numa tabela
            já existente, adiciona as colunas da rotação por idioma (<span class="font-mono">ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN
            IF NOT EXISTS</span>) — rodar de novo é seguro.
        </p>
        <pre id="rot-sql-code" class="bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 p-4 rounded-lg text-[11px] text-gray-300 font-mono overflow-x-auto select-all"></pre>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid principal: formulário + histórico -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-start">
        <!-- Formulário (esquerda) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-5">
            <!-- Modo URL única -->
            <form id="single-rotation-form" class="space-y-4">
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label class="text-xs text-gray-400">URL completa ou slug da obra</label>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600">Ex: multicanaishd.lol/filme/1396-breaking-bad</span>
                    </div>
                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="rot-input-url"
                        placeholder="Cole aqui a URL que foi notificada no Google..."
                        class="w-full bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-xs text-white placeholder:text-gray-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#DF0912]/60 transition-colors font-mono"
                        required
                    />
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                    <div class="space-y-1.5">
                        <label class="text-xs text-gray-400">Tipo de conteúdo</label>
                        <select id="rot-forced-type" class="w-full bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#DF0912]/60 transition-colors">
                            <option value="">Auto-detectar pela URL</option>
                            <option value="movie">Filme (/filme/)</option>
                            <option value="series">Série (/serie/)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-1.5">
                        <label class="text-xs text-gray-400">Idioma da rotação</label>
                        <!-- "Ambos" faz duas chamadas de API (pt e en): a obra tem uma linha só,
                             com colunas separadas por idioma em url_rotations. -->
                        <select id="rot-lang" class="w-full bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#DF0912]/60 transition-colors">
                            <option value="pt">Português (pt) — padrão</option>
                            <option value="en">Inglês (/en/)</option>
                            <option value="ambos">Ambos (pt + en)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-1.5">
                        <label class="text-xs text-gray-400">Slug personalizado (opcional)</label>
                        <input
                            type="text"
                            id="rot-custom-slug"
                            placeholder="Vazio = autoincremento (-1, -2...)"
                            class="w-full bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-white placeholder:text-gray-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#DF0912]/60 transition-colors font-mono"
                        />
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button
                    type="submit"
                    id="btn-submit-rotation"
                    class="w-full bg-[#DF0912] hover:bg-[#be080f] text-white font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                >
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
                    <span>Rotacionar URL da obra</span>
                    <div id="rot-single-spinner" class="animate-spin h-3.5 w-3.5 border-2 border-white border-t-transparent rounded-full hidden"></div>
                </button>
            </form>

            <!-- Modo lote de URLs (hidden por padrão) -->
            <form id="batch-rotation-form" class="space-y-4 hidden">
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label class="text-xs text-gray-400">Idioma do lote</label>
                    <!-- "Ambos" faz duas chamadas de lote (pt e en): uma linha por obra na tabela,
                         com colunas separadas por idioma. -->
                    <select id="rot-batch-lang" class="w-full bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#DF0912]/60 transition-colors">
                        <option value="pt">Português (pt) — padrão</option>
                        <option value="en">Inglês (/en/)</option>
                        <option value="ambos">Ambos (pt + en)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label class="text-xs text-gray-400">URLs ou slugs em lote (uma por linha)</label>
                        <button
                            type="button"
                            id="btn-format-batch"
                            class="text-[10px] font-medium px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/10 hover:bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1"
                            title="Desofusca hxxps://, [.], &amp; e remove parâmetros residuais (?season=...)"
                        >
                            <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
                            <span>Formatar / desofuscar</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <textarea
                        id="rot-batch-input"
                        rows="6"
                        placeholder="https://multicanaishd.lol/filme/603-matrix&#10;https://multicanaishd.lol/serie/1396-breaking-bad&#10;157336-interstellar"
                        class="w-full bg-[#060911] border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-3.5 text-xs text-white placeholder:text-gray-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#DF0912]/60 transition-colors font-mono leading-relaxed"
                        required
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <button
                    type="submit"
                    id="btn-submit-batch"
                    class="w-full bg-[#DF0912] hover:bg-[#be080f] text-white font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                >
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/></svg>
                    <span>Executar rotação em lote</span>
                    <div id="rot-batch-spinner" class="animate-spin h-3.5 w-3.5 border-2 border-white border-t-transparent rounded-full hidden"></div>
                </button>
            </form>

            <!-- Feedback de ação -->
            <div id="rot-action-feedback" class="hidden p-3.5 rounded-lg border text-xs"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Histórico de rotações (direita) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
            <div class="p-4 border-b border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
                <h4 class="text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                    Histórico (<span id="rot-history-count" class="font-mono text-gray-400">0</span>)
                </h4>
                <button id="refresh-rotations-btn" type="button" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors text-xs font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    Atualizar
                    <div id="rot-history-loader" class="animate-spin h-2.5 w-2.5 border-2 border-[#DF0912] border-t-transparent rounded-full hidden"></div>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div id="rot-history-list" class="divide-y divide-white/[0.06] max-h-[520px] overflow-y-auto">
                <!-- Dynamic Items -->
            </div>

            <div id="rot-history-empty" class="p-10 text-center">
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Nenhuma rotação ativa cadastrada.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
